C03: the real identity of someone never named asks whom (KNOWLEDGE1523)

KNOWLEDGE1144/1149 measured that «¿Cuál es su identidad secreta?» and «¿Quién es de verdad?», with nobody named and nothing before them, received answers about a character or a contentless deflection. `_unresolved_input_kind` now names «missing_person_referent» (the real identity or name of «su»/«he/she» with no antecedent) and `clarify_unresolved_input` composes a validated question asking whom the person means, rejecting character names and BAXY's own identity, with one corrected retry; verified offline against the same model («¿De quién hablás?»).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


